  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell initially functions as message (allowing no save or spell resistance). Once during the message effect, you can concentrate as a standard action to issue a suggestion to one target as part of delivering a message. Spell resistance and a Will save apply to the suggestion, and it lasts for 1 hour per level or until completed.",
